Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:35:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 26/31] Finder: zebra stripes follow the layout instantly; hide
 + without tabs

The view now draws all list stripes from the layouter's row positions and
repaints on every layout, instead of each row drawing its own once its
move animation ends. Switching from list to icons no longer leaves stripes
behind, and switching to list shows them at once. The new-tab + is only
shown with the tab strip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
